# Byte-level checkout discipline.
#
# This repository's test suite asserts byte-level md5 pins (frozen8's frozen
# eight, the precedent/recipe stations, the registry anchors). GitHub runners
# check out with different autocrlf behaviour per platform -- Windows CRLF,
# POSIX LF -- so a pin recorded from one worktree shape never matches a
# checkout of another shape, and the same commit verifies green on the
# developer worktree while failing every platform runner.
#
# Pin the checkout to LF on every platform so the asserted bytes are the
# committed bytes. Every blob in this repository is already LF, so this adds
# no renormalization churn.
* text=auto eol=lf
